    "title": "K1 Speed starts construction on indoor facility in Avon - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Rodger Roeser, special to cleveland.com ,\n10 hours ago AVON, Ohio -- Indoor go-kart operator K1 Speed said construction is officially starting this week on its new Avon center. The Avon location will provide the Cleveland area with 70,000 square feet of indoor entertainment options, including electric go-kart racing and arcade games. This new center joins existing locations in... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
